Constant Description <code>AcksNone</code> No acknowledgment (fire and forget) <code>AcksLeader</code> Wait for leader acknowledgment <code>AcksAll</code> Wait for all in-sync replicas <pre><code>cfg := &amp;franz.ProducerConfig{
    // ...
    Acks: franz.AcksAll, // Maximum durability
}
</code></pre>
